    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχ-εσιπλήτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
